# The firework rocket's behaviour is not ported yet. 1.20.6's FireworkRocketEntity rides a gliding
# player and adds look * 0.1 + (look * 1.5 - velocity) * 0.5 to their velocity every tick, and
# nothing in mod_api.json spawns that entity or changes a player's velocity. The rocket's crafting
# recipe is the reference's and is registered all the same. about.json records the gap as a
# deviation against #915.
